            <Version>1.12.0</Version>
            <Comment>Version bump to 1.12.0. Build against libsoup3 instead of libsoup2. libosinfo loaded libsoup-2.4 into virt-manager while spice-gtk uses libsoup3, which made libsoup3 abort the whole process ("libsoup2 symbols detected. Using libsoup2 and libsoup3 in the same process is not supported") whenever the VM console was opened.</Comment>
